@Chakra.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5277

# Isi token JWT Supabase dan id dari response sebelumnya
@adminToken = <eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjEwZDZkNjk2LTNiZmQtNDkzZS1hODVkLTg2MDk5ZWE5NzBiMSIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..erGtXdVmr8sZQYX1yPnbJ40YGxvnGMpO3daYzXR3XsgcxKnNQZdQZbw1NL4fncWDY22eEoDUfRO25q_uHvKfAw>
@userToken = <jwt user biasa>
@userId = <guid user pemilik premi>
@premiId = <guid premi>
@installmentId = <guid cicilan>
@otherPremiId = <guid premi milik user lain>
@otherInstallmentId = <guid cicilan milik user lain>

### 1. Admin buat premi: 12.000.000 / 7, cicilan 1 jatuh tempo 15 Jan 2027
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 12000000,
  "tenor": 7,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 1b. Jadwal cicilan (1-6 = 1.714.285, 7 = 1.714.290)
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/installments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. DueDay 31: harus 31 Jan, 28 Feb, 31 Mar 2027
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 300000,
  "tenor": 3,
  "dueDay": 31,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-31"
}

### 3a. Total lebih kecil dari tenor -> 400
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 5,
  "tenor": 12,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 3b. Total bukan rupiah bulat -> 400
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 1000000.50,
  "tenor": 12,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 4-7. Bayar cicilan (urutan, bayar ulang, sampai lunas)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Detail premi: Status, RemainingAmount, NextDueDate
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8-9. Cancel premi
PATCH {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. User biasa bayar -> 403
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10b. User biasa cancel -> 403
PATCH {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. User biasa: hanya premi miliknya
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. User biasa: premi orang lain -> 404
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{otherPremiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12b. User biasa: cicilan orang lain -> 404
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{otherInstallmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi

### Midtrans
# Persiapan: tunnel aktif, Notification URL sandbox terpasang, user & admin sudah link Telegram.
# Bayar lewat simulator: https://simulator.sandbox.midtrans.com
@installmentId2 = <guid cicilan 2 (premi yang sama)>
@installmentId3 = <guid cicilan 3 (premi yang sama)>
@premiIdB = <guid premi B (skenario 7, akan di-cancel)>
@installmentIdPremiB = <guid cicilan di premi B (skenario 7)>
@installmentIdPremiC = <guid cicilan N di premi C yang aktif (skenario 8)>
@paymentId = <guid payment transaction dari GET /api/payments/unapplied>

### M1. User minta link bayar cicilan 1 -> 200 { orderId, redirectUrl/token }
# Manual: buka redirectUrl, pilih BCA VA, bayar di simulator.
# Harapan: cicilan Paid (MidtransOrderId = order), transaksi Paid, Telegram "Pembayaran cicilan ke-1 sebesar Rp... berhasil."
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M1b. Cek cicilan setelah bayar -> Paid
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M2. Minta link cicilan 2 dua kali -> orderId sama (jalankan 2x)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId2}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M3. Minta link cicilan 3 saat cicilan 2 belum lunas -> 400 "Previous installments must be paid first."
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId3}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M4. Kirim ulang notifikasi (idempotensi)
# Manual: di dashboard sandbox Midtrans, resend notifikasi transaksi skenario 1.
# Harapan: 200, tidak ada perubahan data, tidak ada Telegram kedua.

### M5. Notifikasi palsu dengan signature_key asal -> 401
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/midtrans/notification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "INST-FAKE-ORDER",
  "status_code": "200",
  "gross_amount": "1714285.00",
  "signature_key": "signature-asal-asalan",
  "transaction_status": "settlement",
  "fraud_status": "accept"
}

### M6. Link tanpa pilih metode bayar, lalu admin bayar manual cicilan 2
# Langkah 1: buat link cicilan 2 (jangan buka/pilih metode bayar)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId2}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M6b. Langkah 2: admin bayar manual cicilan 2 -> 200
# Harapan: transaksi jadi Expired dalam +-60 detik (expire dibalas 404 tetap dianggap sukses).
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId2}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### M7. Premi B: buat link
# Manual: buka redirectUrl, pilih VA di simulator, JANGAN bayar dulu.
# Harapan: 200 + link; transaksi Pending.
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentIdPremiB}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M7b. Admin cancel premi B, lalu bayar VA di simulator
# Harapan: jika expire sudah jalan simulator menolak. Jika lolos: transaksi Unapplied(PremiNotActive) + Telegram ke admin.
PATCH {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiIdB}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### M7c. Allocate pada premi tidak aktif -> 400 "Premi is not active, this payment can only be refunded."
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/allocate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "coba alokasi"
}

### M7d. Refund -> 200, transaksi Refunded
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "TRF-001",
  "note": "refund manual"
}

### M8. Premi aktif: buat link cicilan N, pilih VA
# Langkah: (1) request link di bawah, pilih VA di simulator tanpa bayar,
# (2) admin bayar manual cicilan N SEBELUM expire jalan (M8b), (3) bayar VA di simulator.
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentIdPremiC}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M8b. Admin bayar manual cicilan N -> 200
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentIdPremiC}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### M8c. Setelah bayar VA: daftar unapplied (admin) -> transaksi Unapplied(InstallmentAlreadyPaid), canAllocate: true
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/payments/unapplied
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### M8d. Allocate -> cicilan N+1 Paid dengan PaidAt = waktu bayar VA
# PENTING: set ulang @paymentId dari GET /api/payments/unapplied (M8c), jangan pakai nilai skenario 7.
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/allocate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "alokasi ke cicilan berikutnya"
}

### M9. User biasa lihat unapplied -> 403
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/payments/unapplied
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### M10. User biasa minta link cicilan milik orang lain -> 404
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{otherInstallmentId}}/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Scheduler
# Persiapan: premi jatuh tempo 15 Jan 2027, GracePeriodDays 7, user sudah link Telegram.
# Endpoint run hanya ada di Development, hanya admin. Efeknya nyata (transaksi Snap + pesan Telegram sungguhan).
@runDate = 2027-01-12

### S0. Run tanpa date -> 400 "Query parameter 'date' (yyyy-MM-dd) is required."
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S0b. User biasa -> 403 "Forbidden"
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date={{runDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### S1. date 2027-01-11 -> tidak ada pesan, status Pending
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-11
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S2. date 2027-01-12 -> pesan Upcoming + link Snap, status Reminder1, ReminderCount 1
# Jalankan lagi (S3) -> tidak ada pesan kedua
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-12
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S4a. date 2027-01-14 -> DueTomorrow (+Reminder2)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-14
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S4b. date 2027-01-15 -> DueToday
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-15
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S4c. date 2027-01-18 -> pesan GracePeriod "masa tenggang berakhir 22 Jan 2027"
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-18
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S4d. date 2027-01-21 -> pesan GracePeriod "masa tenggang berakhir 22 Jan 2027"
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-21
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S5. date 2027-01-23 -> status Overdue, tidak ada pesan (mengasumsikan S4c dan S4d sudah dijalankan)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-23
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S6. date 2027-01-24 -> pesan Overdue "terlambat 9 hari"
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-24
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S7. Premi baru, langsung date = H+10 (2027-01-25) -> satu pesan Overdue (catch-up), status langsung Overdue
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-25
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S8a. Pause pengingat premi (jalankan 2x: kedua -> 400 "Reminders are already paused.")
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/reminders/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S8a-user. Pause oleh user biasa -> 403
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/reminders/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### S8b. S8 dijalankan setelah S6/S7. date 2027-01-27 (slot berikutnya, D+12) saat pause -> tidak ada pesan
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-27
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S8c. Resume, lalu jalankan S8b lagi (date=2027-01-27) -> pesan Overdue "terlambat 12 hari"
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/reminders/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S9. date 2027-02-11 -> alert admin sekali; jalankan lagi -> tidak dobel
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-02-11
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S10-S11. Cicilan 1 dibayar lalu date = H-3 cicilan 2 (2027-02-12) -> pesan cicilan ke-2, link bisa dibayar
# Cicilan 2 belum lunas, cicilan 3 lewat masa tenggang -> hanya cicilan 2 diingatkan, cicilan 3 Overdue tanpa pesan
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-02-12
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### S13. Nasabah belum link Telegram, date = H-3 -> tidak ada transaksi baru di PaymentTransactions,
# LastRemindedOn null, ringkasan skipped 1. Link Telegram lalu jalankan lagi -> pesan terkirim.
# Butuh premi terpisah yang user-nya BELUM link Telegram.
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/daily-reminders/run?date=2027-01-12
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# Reset manual untuk mengulang skenario (SQL, jalankan di database; sesuaikan WHERE):
# UPDATE "Installments" SET "LastRemindedOn" = NULL, "OverdueAlertSentOn" = NULL, "ReminderCount" = 0, "Status" = 'Pending' WHERE ...;

# S12 (worker): set Scheduler:RunAtLocalTime ke beberapa menit ke depan -> satu baris JobRuns Succeeded;
#   restart API -> tidak jalan dua kali.
#
# S15 (mode menit, Development): di appsettings.Development.json isi
#   "Scheduler": { "TimeScale": "Minutes", "SimulationStartDate": "2027-01-10" }
#   premi jatuh tempo 15 Jan 2027, masa tenggang 7, lalu start API. 1 menit nyata = 1 hari simulasi:
#   menit ke-2 Upcoming, ke-4 DueTomorrow, ke-5 DueToday, ke-8 dan ke-11 GracePeriod,
#   ke-13 status Overdue, ke-14 pesan terlambat, ke-32 alert admin. Satu baris JobRuns per tanggal simulasi.
#   Restart mengulang dari SimulationStartDate; tanggal yang sudah punya JobRun dilewati.
#
# S16 (guard Production): TimeScale "Minutes" dengan ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production
#   -> API gagal start dengan pesan TimeScale
#   ("Scheduler TimeScale 'Minutes' is only allowed in Development and requires SimulationStartDate.").
